{"html":"<span id=\"docker-镜像详解\" class=\"article-title-anchor\"></span>\n<h2 id=\"什么是镜像image\">什么是镜像（Image）</h2>\n<p><strong>镜像</strong> 是一种轻量级、可执行的独立软件包，用于打包应用程序及其运行环境。它包含了运行某个程序所需的一切内容，例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应用代码</li>\n<li>运行时环境</li>\n<li>系统工具</li>\n<li>系统库</li>\n<li>配置文件</li>\n</ul>\n<p>镜像是 <strong>容器的基础</strong>，容器的运行就是基于镜像的实例化。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像与容器的区别\">镜像与容器的区别</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格，可横向滚动\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>镜像（Image）</th>\n<th>容器（Container）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>性质</td>\n<td>只读模板，静态的</td>\n<td>镜像的运行实例，动态的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类比</td>\n<td>类似于类的定义</td>\n<td>类似于类的对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>分层存储，不可变</td>\n<td>在镜像基础上添加可写层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>持久存在</td>\n<td>可以启动、停止、删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像的分层机制\">镜像的分层机制</h2>\n<h3 id=\"unionfs-分层结构\">UnionFS 分层结构</h3>\n<p>Docker 镜像采用 <strong>UnionFS 分层结构</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每一层是只读的，多个镜像可以共享相同的底层</li>\n<li>容器运行时会在镜像上方添加一层可写层（Writable Layer）</li>\n<li>分层机制让镜像的存储和分发更高效</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"分层优势\">分层优势</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>存储效率</strong>：相同的基础层可以被多个镜像共享</li>\n<li><strong>传输效率</strong>：只需要传输不同的层</li>\n<li><strong>构建效率</strong>：可以利用缓存，只重新构建变更的层</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"提交机制\">提交机制</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 提交容器为镜像</span>\ndocker commit &lt;容器ID&gt; &lt;镜像名:标签&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>提交时，实际上是把容器的写入层保存为新的镜像层。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像的基本操作\">镜像的基本操作</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-查看镜像\">1. 查看镜像</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 查看本地镜像</span>\ndocker images\ndocker image <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">ls</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 查看镜像详细信息</span>\ndocker inspect &lt;镜像名:标签&gt;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 查看镜像历史</span>\ndocker <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">history</span> &lt;镜像名:标签&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-搜索镜像\">2. 搜索镜像</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 在 Docker Hub 搜索镜像</span>\ndocker search nginx\ndocker search python\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-删除镜像\">3. 删除镜像</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 删除单个镜像</span>\ndocker rmi &lt;镜像名:标签&gt;\ndocker image <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">rm</span> &lt;镜像名:标签&gt;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 删除所有镜像</span>\ndocker rmi $(docker images -q)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 删除悬空镜像（dangling images）</span>\ndocker image prune\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-镜像标签管理\">4. 镜像标签管理</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 给镜像打标签</span>\ndocker tag &lt;源镜像&gt; &lt;新标签&gt;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 示例</span>\ndocker tag nginx:latest mynginx:v1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"获取镜像的方式\">获取镜像的方式</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-从远程仓库下载\">1. 从远程仓库下载</h3>\n<h4 id=\"docker-hub官方公共仓库\">Docker Hub（官方公共仓库）</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 下载最新版本</span>\ndocker pull nginx:latest\ndocker pull mysql:8.0\ndocker pull python:3.10\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 下载指定版本</span>\ndocker pull nginx:1.20\ndocker pull mysql:8.0.25\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"私有仓库\">私有仓库</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 从私有仓库下载</span>\ndocker pull registry.company.com/myapp:v1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 登录私有仓库</span>\ndocker login registry.company.com\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-自己制作\">2. 自己制作</h3>\n<p>使用 <code>Dockerfile</code> 定义镜像的构建步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 构建镜像</span>\ndocker build -t myapp:1.0 .\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 指定 Dockerfile 路径</span>\ndocker build -f /path/to/Dockerfile -t myapp:1.0 .\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-镜像导入导出\">3. 镜像导入导出</h3>\n<h4 id=\"导出镜像\">导出镜像</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 导出单个镜像</span>\ndocker save -o myapp.tar myapp:1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 导出多个镜像</span>\ndocker save -o images.tar nginx:latest mysql:8.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 使用压缩</span>\ndocker save myapp:1.0 | gzip &gt; myapp.tar.gz\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"导入镜像\">导入镜像</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 导入镜像</span>\ndocker load -i myapp.tar\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 从压缩文件导入</span>\ngunzip -c myapp.tar.gz | docker load\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像推送与分发\">镜像推送与分发</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-推送到-docker-hub\">1. 推送到 Docker Hub</h3>\n<h4 id=\"准备工作\">准备工作</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 登录 Docker Hub</span>\ndocker login\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 输入用户名和密码</span>\nUsername: yourusername\nPassword: ********\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"推送镜像\">推送镜像</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 给镜像打标签（必须包含用户名）</span>\ndocker tag myapp:1.0 yourusername/myapp:1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推送到 Docker Hub</span>\ndocker push yourusername/myapp:1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推送多个标签</span>\ndocker push yourusername/myapp:latest\ndocker push yourusername/myapp:1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-推送到私有仓库\">2. 推送到私有仓库</h3>\n<h4 id=\"搭建私有仓库\">搭建私有仓库</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 启动私有仓库</span>\ndocker run -d -p 5000:5000 --name registry registry:2\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 或使用 Docker Compose</span>\nversion: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;3&#x27;</span>\nservices:\n  registry:\n    image: registry:2\n    ports:\n      - <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;5000:5000&quot;</span>\n    volumes:\n      - registry-data:/var/lib/registry\n\nvolumes:\n  registry-data:\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"推送到私有仓库\">推送到私有仓库</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 给镜像打标签</span>\ndocker tag myapp:1.0 localhost:5000/myapp:1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推送到私有仓库</span>\ndocker push localhost:5000/myapp:1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 从私有仓库拉取</span>\ndocker pull localhost:5000/myapp:1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-企业级镜像仓库\">3. 企业级镜像仓库</h3>\n<h4 id=\"harbor推荐\">Harbor（推荐）</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 登录 Harbor</span>\ndocker login harbor.company.com\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推送镜像</span>\ndocker tag myapp:1.0 harbor.company.com/project/myapp:1.0\ndocker push harbor.company.com/project/myapp:1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"nexus-repository\">Nexus Repository</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 配置 Docker 仓库</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 在 Nexus 中创建 Docker 仓库后使用</span>\ndocker tag myapp:1.0 nexus.company.com:8081/myapp:1.0\ndocker push nexus.company.com:8081/myapp:1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像的版本管理\">镜像的版本管理</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-标签策略\">1. 标签策略</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 语义化版本</span>\nmyapp:1.0.0\nmyapp:1.0.1\nmyapp:2.0.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 环境标签</span>\nmyapp:dev\nmyapp:<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">test</span>\nmyapp:prod\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 时间标签</span>\nmyapp:2024-01-15\nmyapp:20240115\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 分支标签</span>\nmyapp:main\nmyapp:feature-auth\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-多架构镜像\">2. 多架构镜像</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 构建多架构镜像</span>\ndocker buildx create --use\ndocker buildx build --platform linux/amd64,linux/arm64 -t myapp:1.0 --push .\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-镜像签名\">3. 镜像签名</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 使用 Docker Content Trust</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">export</span> DOCKER_CONTENT_TRUST=1\ndocker push myapp:1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像优化策略\">镜像优化策略</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-选择合适的基础镜像\">1. 选择合适的基础镜像</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推荐：使用 Alpine</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> python:<span class=\"hljs-number\">3.10</span>-alpine\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 避免：使用完整 Ubuntu</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> ubuntu:<span class=\"hljs-number\">20.04</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-多阶段构建\">2. 多阶段构建</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 构建阶段</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:<span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span> AS builder\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> package*.json ./</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> npm ci --only=production</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 运行阶段</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:<span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>-alpine\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> --from=builder /app/node_modules ./node_modules</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> . .</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">CMD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;npm&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;start&quot;</span>]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-清理缓存\">3. 清理缓存</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> apt-get update &amp;&amp; \\\n    apt-get install -y curl &amp;&amp; \\\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">rm</span> -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-使用-dockerignore\">4. 使用 .dockerignore</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerignore</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerignore\">.git\nnode_modules\n*.log\n.env\n.DS_Store\ncoverage/\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像安全最佳实践\">镜像安全最佳实践</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-基础镜像安全\">1. 基础镜像安全</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 扫描镜像漏洞</span>\ndocker scan myapp:1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 使用安全的基础镜像</span>\nFROM python:3.10-slim\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-最小权限原则\">2. 最小权限原则</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 创建非 root 用户</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> addgroup -g 1001 -S nodejs</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> adduser -S nextjs -u 1001</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">USER</span> nextjs\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-镜像签名验证\">3. 镜像签名验证</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 验证镜像签名</span>\ndocker trust inspect myapp:1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题\">常见问题</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-如何减小镜像大小\">1. 如何减小镜像大小？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Alpine 基础镜像</li>\n<li>多阶段构建</li>\n<li>清理不必要的文件和缓存</li>\n<li>使用 .dockerignore</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-如何提高镜像构建速度\">2. 如何提高镜像构建速度？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>合理利用层缓存</li>\n<li>并行安装依赖</li>\n<li>使用构建缓存</li>\n<li>优化 Dockerfile 指令顺序</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-如何管理镜像版本\">3. 如何管理镜像版本？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>使用语义化版本号</li>\n<li>为不同环境打不同标签</li>\n<li>定期清理旧版本镜像</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-如何备份和恢复镜像\">4. 如何备份和恢复镜像？</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 备份</span>\ndocker save -o backup.tar myapp:1.0\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 恢复</span>\ndocker load -i backup.tar\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2>\n<p>Docker 镜像是容器化应用的核心，掌握镜像的创建、管理、推送和优化对于构建高效的容器化应用至关重要。通过合理使用镜像分层机制、选择合适的构建策略和遵循安全最佳实践，可以创建出高质量、安全的生产级镜像。</p>\n","toc":[{"level":2,"text":"什么是镜像（Image）","id":"什么是镜像image"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像与容器的区别","id":"镜像与容器的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像的分层机制","id":"镜像的分层机制"},{"level":3,"text":"UnionFS 分层结构","id":"unionfs-分层结构"},{"level":3,"text":"分层优势","id":"分层优势"},{"level":3,"text":"提交机制","id":"提交机制"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像的基本操作","id":"镜像的基本操作"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 查看镜像","id":"1-查看镜像"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 搜索镜像","id":"2-搜索镜像"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 删除镜像","id":"3-删除镜像"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 镜像标签管理","id":"4-镜像标签管理"},{"level":2,"text":"获取镜像的方式","id":"获取镜像的方式"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 从远程仓库下载","id":"1-从远程仓库下载"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 自己制作","id":"2-自己制作"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 镜像导入导出","id":"3-镜像导入导出"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像推送与分发","id":"镜像推送与分发"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 推送到 Docker Hub","id":"1-推送到-docker-hub"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 推送到私有仓库","id":"2-推送到私有仓库"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 企业级镜像仓库","id":"3-企业级镜像仓库"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像的版本管理","id":"镜像的版本管理"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 标签策略","id":"1-标签策略"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 多架构镜像","id":"2-多架构镜像"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 镜像签名","id":"3-镜像签名"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像优化策略","id":"镜像优化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 选择合适的基础镜像","id":"1-选择合适的基础镜像"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 多阶段构建","id":"2-多阶段构建"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 清理缓存","id":"3-清理缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 使用 .dockerignore","id":"4-使用-dockerignore"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像安全最佳实践","id":"镜像安全最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 基础镜像安全","id":"1-基础镜像安全"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 最小权限原则","id":"2-最小权限原则"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 镜像签名验证","id":"3-镜像签名验证"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题","id":"常见问题"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 如何减小镜像大小？","id":"1-如何减小镜像大小"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 如何提高镜像构建速度？","id":"2-如何提高镜像构建速度"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 如何管理镜像版本？","id":"3-如何管理镜像版本"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 如何备份和恢复镜像？","id":"4-如何备份和恢复镜像"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}]}